3. The error was occurring because the app object didn't have the `categories` array that the AppCard component was trying to access. By providing this array and other required properties, the component should now render correctly.

These changes should resolve the "Cannot read properties of undefined (reading '0')" error by ensuring all required properties are available and the necessary context is provided.

